/**
 * FORK & SHARE — Weekly Meal Schedule Logic (pages/weekly-schedule.html)
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 * 1. Render the Monday-to-Sunday x Breakfast/Lunch/Dinner schedule grid from data.
 * 2. Pre-seed Week 1 with the realistic prototype menu on first visit while
 *    preserving user edits and explicit clears in localStorage.
 * 3. Place an accessible <img> element immediately after every food item's name
 *    with a clean fallback to ../images/meal-placeholder.jpg if needed.
 * 4. Support adding, updating, and removing meals via an accessible modal.
 * 5. Sync weekly meal plans and shopping list items with meal-planner.html and
 *    shopping-list.html via shared localStorage keys.
 */

